## Performance

The quadtree outperforms a linear array scan at every tested size (10000
random point queries, 1024×768 world, rects sized 20–100px):

| Rects | Array (full scan) | Quadtree | Speedup |
|------:|------------------:|---------:|--------:|
|    50 |           3.50 ms |  1.83 ms |     1.9×|
|   200 |          17.09 ms |  3.07 ms |     5.6×|
|  1000 |          94.91 ms |  5.04 ms |    18.8×|
|  5000 |         471.39 ms | 12.00 ms |    39.3×|

See `research/` for the benchmark source and full results.
